    <string name="legal_privacy">Privacy Policy</string>
    <string name="legal_help_body">Use search and filters to find listings, or turn on \"Nearby\" to see pets close to you.\n\nTap the heart to keep a pet in your favourites. As a guest they stay on this device; after you sign in you can move them to your account.\n\nTo adopt, open a listing and tap \"Apply\". If you have no account yet, you will return to the same application right after a short sign-up.</string>
    <string name="legal_terms_body">MIYAV is a community platform for finding homes for pets.\n\nAnyone can browse listings without an account. Posting listings, applying for adoption and contacting owners need an account.\n\nListing owners are responsible for the accuracy of their listings. Selling animals and fake or abusive listings are not allowed and are removed; accounts that break these rules are suspended.\n\nTo keep members safe and enforce these rules, MIYAV moderators may read conversations and chat photos, for example after a report. Every such review is logged.\n\nA premium listing costs 5 ₼ for 7 days, paid by M10 or bank card transfer. It starts after an administrator confirms the payment receipt. Premium listings follow the same rules as every other listing.</string>
