    <string name="legal_privacy_body">While you browse as a guest, no account data is collected. Favourites stay on this device and are never moved to an account without your consent.\n\nWhen you create an account, your email, name and profile details are stored. Your email address and messages are never shown publicly.\n\nListing locations are rounded to about 100 metres. Your phone number is shown only if you allow it, and only to signed-in users.\n\nYou can delete your account at any time from Profile → Delete account: your profile, listings, applications, messages and photos are removed permanently.\n\nMessages are private between the two members, but MIYAV moderators may review them for safety and to enforce the Terms of Service; each review is logged. Payment receipts you upload are seen only by you and the administrators.</string>
